@startuml state-color-mode
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
hide empty description
mainframe stm 색 모드 (Resident.colorPolicy)

state "Single Color" as Single
state Single : entry / repaint()
state Single : tick() [changed] / repaint()

state "Cycle by Generation" as Cycling
state Cycling : entry / repaint()
state Cycling : tick() / repaint()

[*] --> Single : 프로그램 시작

Single --> Cycling : Cycle by Generation 선택\n/ setColorPolicy(new CyclingColorPolicy(...))
Cycling --> Single : Single Color 선택\n/ setColorPolicy(new FixedColorPolicy(LIVE_COLOR))
Single --> Single : Single Color 선택\n/ setColorPolicy(new FixedColorPolicy(LIVE_COLOR))
Cycling --> Cycling : Cycle by Generation 선택\n/ setColorPolicy(new CyclingColorPolicy(...))

note bottom of Cycling
  Single: colorPolicy가 FixedColorPolicy
  Cycling: colorPolicy가 CyclingColorPolicy
  셀의 나이는 모드와 상관없이 매 틱 센다.
  모드를 바꿔도 나이는 그대로다
end note
@enduml
